# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rankridge — project ignore rules
#
# Scope note: this file only governs the rankridge_app/ subtree. See the
# warning at the bottom about where this repository is actually rooted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Signing credentials: never commit -------------------------------------
# keystore.properties holds the release store/key passwords in plain text, and
# a .jks/.keystore IS the signing identity. If either reaches a remote, the key
# must be treated as compromised and the app re-keyed.
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pepk
google-services.json
play-service-account*.json

# --- Local machine config ---------------------------------------------------
# local.properties pins the absolute Android SDK path, which differs per machine.
local.properties
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Gradle / Android build output ------------------------------------------
# Build output is redirected to C:\AndroidBuilds\rankridge_app by the root
# android/build.gradle.kts (to keep OneDrive from locking files mid-write), so
# these mostly will not appear — kept as a safety net for anyone building with
# that redirect removed.
.gradle/
build/
captures/
.cxx/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
release/
lint-results*.html
lint-results*.xml

# --- IDE --------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- Node / web (web/ also carries its own .gitignore) ----------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- OS ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Misc -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
